WEBVTT

00:11.140 --> 00:12.270
<b>Omitsu!</b>

00:12.410 --> 00:13.540
<b>You can do this!</b>

00:20.580 --> 00:23.450
<b>What's taking Mr. Koyanagi so long?</b>

00:23.590 --> 00:25.020
<b>Of all the days!</b>

00:25.150 --> 00:28.020
<b>Arresting a thief's more important than his wife?</b>

00:28.760 --> 00:30.230
<b>You're almost there!</b>

00:33.260 --> 00:35.230
<b>It's born!</b>

00:35.700 --> 00:37.630
<b>There.</b>

00:38.270 --> 00:41.140
<b>Yasugoro...</b>

00:51.310 --> 00:54.420
<b>How could this be?</b>

00:55.450 --> 00:57.390
<b>Omitsu.</b>

00:58.320 --> 01:01.190
<b>Omitsu!</b>

01:02.430 --> 01:03.430
<b>Omitsu!</b>

01:18.640 --> 01:20.480
<b>Omitsu.</b>

01:33.860 --> 01:35.860
<b>Omitsu.</b>

01:37.230 --> 01:39.700
<b>I'm sorry...</b>

01:40.230 --> 01:42.260
<b>I couldn't be by your side.</b>

01:46.400 --> 01:49.640
<b>Forgive me, Koyanagi.</b>

02:50.930 --> 02:54.940
<b>The Audacious Fellow</b>

02:56.670 --> 02:59.340
<b>Tsuboi Dojo</b>

03:07.720 --> 03:10.620
<b>-There's a tense air around him.
-Yes.</b>

03:10.750 --> 03:14.320
<b>Koyanagi used to always be the calm one.</b>

03:21.200 --> 03:24.830
<b>He's a completely different person.</b>

03:27.500 --> 03:28.540
<b>Next!</b>

03:30.340 --> 03:31.410
<b>Wha--?</b>

03:32.680 --> 03:34.440
<b>Ouch.</b>

03:34.580 --> 03:39.820
<b>That man's crazy! He didn't go easy on me at all!</b>

03:40.380 --> 03:44.590
<b>How could he do that to Heizo Hasegawa's heir?</b>

03:44.890 --> 03:46.890
<b>You're whose heir?</b>

03:47.220 --> 03:48.220
<b>Father!</b>

03:48.860 --> 03:51.730
<b>At least he's a little more decent.</b>

03:53.760 --> 03:55.260
<b>I guess he is.</b>

03:56.230 --> 03:57.670
<b>So who was it?</b>

03:57.800 --> 03:59.700
<b>It was Koyanagi!</b>

04:00.540 --> 04:04.010
<b>He came at me as if he was taking revenge.</b>

04:04.470 --> 04:07.810
<b>I knew you didn't have the aptitude.</b>

04:07.940 --> 04:10.810
<b>But it's about time.</b>

04:10.950 --> 04:14.580
<b>Yes, you've been training for quite some time now.</b>

04:15.450 --> 04:18.550
<b>Master Tsuboi is the mentor you recommended, Father.</b>

04:19.490 --> 04:24.030
<b>So you're also responsible
for my poor progress.</b>

04:24.730 --> 04:31.600
<b>To learn from a man like Master Tsuboi
every day will do you good.</b>

04:38.270 --> 04:39.910
<b>Hey, Hisae.</b>

04:40.740 --> 04:45.350
<b>I can't help but think Koyanagi's hastening his death.</b>

04:45.480 --> 04:46.550
<b>Oh, no.</b>

04:47.350 --> 04:50.790
<b>I can see him intentionally facing danger to die</b>

04:50.920 --> 04:55.790
<b>so he could be with his wife and child.</b>

04:56.330 --> 04:58.430
<b>No.</b>

04:58.560 --> 05:00.460
<b>That can't happen.</b>

05:01.960 --> 05:03.930
<b>Here are some incense sticks.</b>

05:04.070 --> 05:06.740
<b>Please take them to Mr. Koyanagi tomorrow.</b>

05:06.870 --> 05:08.500
<b>That's right.</b>

05:08.870 --> 05:11.510
<b>Tomorrow's their death anniversary.</b>

05:20.920 --> 05:22.520
<b>Forgive me, Omitsu.</b>

05:23.590 --> 05:27.860
<b>Just know that I'm coming to you soon.</b>

06:10.130 --> 06:12.030
<b>Please let me die.</b>

06:12.370 --> 06:14.600
<b>For mercy's sake!</b>

06:20.780 --> 06:22.080
<b>Welcome!</b>

06:22.980 --> 06:25.710
<b>Why, hello, Koyanagi.</b>

06:26.150 --> 06:28.120
<b>What a rare sight.</b>

06:28.450 --> 06:30.890
<b>Do you have a room available in the back?</b>

06:31.020 --> 06:34.090
<b>Sure, go ahead, take it.</b>

06:37.590 --> 06:39.390
<b>This way, please.</b>

06:43.700 --> 06:46.000
<b>Hey, can you bring them</b>

06:46.670 --> 06:48.870
<b>something warm to eat?</b>

06:49.000 --> 06:51.940
<b>Sure can, right away.</b>

06:54.780 --> 06:56.410
<b>They were at Ryokoku Bridge.</b>

06:56.880 --> 06:59.920
<b>She was about to throw herself into the river.</b>

07:00.580 --> 07:03.420
<b>Will you let them stay here for a night?</b>

07:03.590 --> 07:05.750
<b>We can't just abandon them.</b>

07:05.890 --> 07:07.760
<b>Yes, of course.</b>

07:07.890 --> 07:10.030
<b>I'm glad you're here.</b>

07:10.160 --> 07:13.660
<b>She doesn't respond to me
no matter what I say.</b>

07:14.030 --> 07:18.530
<b>She might open up to another woman.</b>

07:19.030 --> 07:21.840
<b>I'll report back to you tomorrow.</b>

07:21.970 --> 07:23.570
<b>Thanks.</b>

07:23.710 --> 07:24.970
<b>There, there.</b>

07:25.110 --> 07:27.640
<b>Please enjoy.</b>

07:31.780 --> 07:34.750
<b>Please, go ahead.</b>

07:44.090 --> 07:46.130
<b>It warmed me up.</b>

07:46.460 --> 07:49.100
<b>That's the idea.</b>

07:50.700 --> 07:52.630
<b>-Is it a girl?
-Yes.</b>

07:52.770 --> 07:56.000
<b>Look how cute she is.</b>

07:57.810 --> 08:00.040
<b>How did I just save lives today?</b>

08:00.640 --> 08:03.980
<b>Today is your wife and child's death anniversary.</b>

08:04.110 --> 08:05.250
<b>Yeah.</b>

08:05.580 --> 08:08.480
<b>I encountered them on the way back
from visiting the grave.</b>

08:08.720 --> 08:11.820
<b>Must be some kind of fate.</b>

08:17.590 --> 08:19.560
<b>-Are you free?
-Koyanagi.</b>

08:19.700 --> 08:21.700
<b>What brings you here?</b>

08:21.830 --> 08:24.530
<b>Let's have a drink.</b>

08:24.670 --> 08:26.130
<b>Of course!</b>

08:26.270 --> 08:28.840
<b>Come on in!</b>

08:31.040 --> 08:34.240
<b>I sense that something good
must have happened.</b>

08:35.510 --> 08:37.650
<b>Is it a lady?</b>

08:37.780 --> 08:39.180
<b>And a baby.</b>

08:39.510 --> 08:40.580
<b>A baby?!</b>

08:41.080 --> 08:42.520
<b>What do you mean?</b>

08:43.220 --> 08:45.890
<b>Did you get someone pregnant?</b>

08:46.020 --> 08:47.590
<b>No, wait.</b>

08:47.720 --> 08:51.830
<b>Were you involved with a widow who has a child?</b>

08:52.090 --> 08:55.960
<b>Come on, spill it to me!</b>

08:56.670 --> 08:57.970
<b>The next day</b>

08:58.730 --> 09:00.670
<b>Welcome.</b>

09:19.090 --> 09:23.730
<b>Koyanagi, don't get startled
at what I'm about to say.</b>

09:24.030 --> 09:27.560
<b>They are the wife and child of a man you arrested.</b>

09:27.700 --> 09:31.600
<b>Matahachi of Shikadome.</b>

09:32.230 --> 09:33.300
<b>Unbelievable.</b>

09:36.570 --> 09:37.810
<b>Shorinji</b>

09:47.280 --> 09:48.580
<b>Suspicious one!</b>

09:51.790 --> 09:52.920
<b>Watch it!</b>

09:57.630 --> 10:00.730
<b>This is the Arson Theft Control!
Do not resist!</b>

10:06.070 --> 10:09.000
<b>She's the wife of that thief.</b>

10:09.140 --> 10:11.670
<b>Her name is Otaka.</b>

10:11.810 --> 10:14.910
<b>She married Matahachi four years ago.</b>

10:15.280 --> 10:20.950
<b>All this time, she believed that her husband
was a true rosary craftsman.</b>

10:27.120 --> 10:28.820
<b>I'll be back.</b>

10:29.190 --> 10:32.190
<b>It's gonna be late, so go ahead and sleep
before I get back.</b>

11:07.960 --> 11:09.200
<b>Are you back?</b>

11:10.800 --> 11:13.800
<b>-Are you... Otaka?
-Yes.</b>

11:15.070 --> 11:19.980
<b>I have a message
from Matahachi for you.</b>

11:21.840 --> 11:24.810
<b>Matahachi was arrested
by the Arson Theft Control?</b>

11:24.950 --> 11:28.020
<b>I know this might be hard to take in all at once.</b>

11:28.350 --> 11:30.720
<b>He's worked as a thief</b>

11:30.950 --> 11:33.390
<b>-for a very long time.
-I don't believe that!</b>

11:38.360 --> 11:40.760
<b>Of course.</b>

11:42.400 --> 11:45.430
<b>Read this calmly.</b>

11:49.810 --> 11:53.340
<b>I've known Matahachi for a very long time.</b>

11:53.480 --> 11:57.880
<b>I held on to that letter for him
in case of emergency.</b>

11:58.010 --> 12:01.480
<b>And... this too.</b>

12:04.920 --> 12:06.390
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

12:06.720 --> 12:08.290
<b>This is all my fault.</b>

12:08.420 --> 12:10.430
<b>I'll do what I can.</b>

12:11.230 --> 12:15.230
<b>So be strong and wait for Matahachi to return.</b>

12:18.270 --> 12:20.270
<b>In Matahachi's letter,</b>

12:20.400 --> 12:25.040
<b>he revealed that he assisted with the robbery</b>

12:25.170 --> 12:28.140
<b>to return a favor to someone.</b>

12:28.280 --> 12:30.450
<b>And if anything happened to him,</b>

12:30.780 --> 12:34.250
<b>for her to take care of his child for him.</b>

12:35.380 --> 12:37.220
<b>I have an idea.</b>

12:37.350 --> 12:39.350
<b>I need about three days.</b>

12:40.120 --> 12:43.190
<b>Don't tell Chief about this.</b>

12:43.330 --> 12:44.860
<b>But...</b>

12:44.990 --> 12:46.760
<b>Trust me.</b>

12:47.400 --> 12:50.030
<b>I'm risking my life for this.</b>

12:51.030 --> 12:53.400
<b>Arson Theft Control</b>

12:59.240 --> 13:01.840
<b>Matahachi of Shikadome.</b>

13:02.880 --> 13:06.880
<b>I've got something to tell you
at my own discretion.</b>

13:07.220 --> 13:10.850
<b>I saved your wife...</b>

13:11.350 --> 13:13.460
<b>from throwing herself in the river.</b>

13:14.790 --> 13:18.130
<b>This has got to be some kind of fate.</b>

13:18.860 --> 13:20.560
<b>Do you believe it?</b>

13:23.230 --> 13:26.430
<b>Seigoro delivered your letter to Otaka.</b>

13:27.340 --> 13:30.210
<b>When Otaka found out that you're a thief,</b>

13:30.340 --> 13:32.940
<b>she was completely devastated.</b>

13:33.070 --> 13:35.540
<b>Neither sending a letter of atonement</b>

13:35.880 --> 13:40.120
<b>or money would alleviate her pain.</b>

13:40.320 --> 13:43.120
<b>What's Seigoro doing?</b>

13:44.090 --> 13:48.490
<b>He was preparing for a journey to find someone.</b>

13:51.330 --> 13:56.570
<b>Otaka is staying at a chicken hot pot shop
near the bridge in Honjo called Gotetsu.</b>

13:56.900 --> 13:58.330
<b>Hey, Matahachi.</b>

13:59.430 --> 14:01.570
<b>If you want to see her, I can make that happen.</b>

14:02.900 --> 14:07.180
<b>You'll see her and return here before sunrise.</b>

14:08.180 --> 14:10.150
<b>I'll accompany you.</b>

14:10.280 --> 14:11.480
<b>But in exchange...</b>

14:11.610 --> 14:15.250
<b>Reveal where my accomplice is hiding...?</b>

14:15.850 --> 14:17.220
<b>Right.</b>

14:17.350 --> 14:19.850
<b>You're a terrible person.</b>

14:19.990 --> 14:21.320
<b>Listen to yourself.</b>

14:21.460 --> 14:22.990
<b>You killed two people.</b>

14:23.120 --> 14:25.130
<b>No! That wasn't me!</b>

14:25.960 --> 14:30.130
<b>I know that it wasn't you, but...</b>

14:30.870 --> 14:33.100
<b>shielding your murderer accomplice</b>

14:33.240 --> 14:35.200
<b>is the same offense.</b>

14:37.940 --> 14:39.270
<b>So, what's gonna happen?</b>

14:39.410 --> 14:40.910
<b>Make your decision now.</b>

14:41.040 --> 14:43.210
<b>Are you seeing your wife or not?</b>

14:43.350 --> 14:45.050
<b>Tell me.</b>

14:45.450 --> 14:49.880
<b>But, is it okay for you to do this?</b>

14:50.020 --> 14:52.450
<b>It's at my own discretion.</b>

14:52.590 --> 14:55.920
<b>Your boss is Heizo the Oni.</b>

14:56.060 --> 14:58.930
<b>Aren't you gonna be in trouble for this?</b>

14:59.460 --> 15:01.430
<b>Don't mind me.</b>

15:01.560 --> 15:07.100
<b>It's more urgent to arrest
your murderer accomplice who's on the loose.</b>

15:09.040 --> 15:12.970
<b>Then I'd like to avail myself of your kind offer.</b>

15:13.110 --> 15:15.340
<b>Please let me see my wife.</b>

15:16.910 --> 15:18.150
<b>All right.</b>

15:18.610 --> 15:21.020
<b>So where is your accomplice,</b>

15:21.150 --> 15:23.550
<b>Monzaburo of Amabata?</b>

15:24.020 --> 15:27.260
<b>I'll tell you after I see Otaka's face.</b>

15:32.290 --> 15:33.560
<b>This is bad!</b>

15:38.330 --> 15:40.140
<b>Explain what happened.</b>

15:40.270 --> 15:45.410
<b>It seems like Koyanagi
let Matahachi go.</b>

15:46.010 --> 15:49.180
<b>Has he gone mad?</b>

15:52.280 --> 15:54.150
<b>-What?!
-Keep quiet.</b>

15:54.280 --> 15:56.650
<b>-We'll send a pursuer out at once.
-Wait.</b>

15:57.520 --> 15:59.650
<b>Do not say a word about this to anyone.</b>

15:59.990 --> 16:02.560
<b>-Do not leak anything outside.
-But...</b>

16:03.160 --> 16:06.090
<b>I'll take all the responsibility.</b>

16:13.570 --> 16:14.570
<b>Matahachi.</b>

16:15.200 --> 16:17.240
<b>It's that bridge.</b>

16:17.710 --> 16:20.340
<b>She tried throwing herself in the river from there.</b>

16:25.110 --> 16:27.120
<b>Excuse me!</b>

16:43.530 --> 16:46.570
<b>Arson Theft Control</b>

16:52.670 --> 16:54.380
<b>I'm terribly sorry.</b>

16:55.240 --> 16:57.280
<b>If you have something to say, say it now.</b>

16:59.580 --> 17:00.680
<b>No.</b>

17:03.690 --> 17:05.220
<b>Sajima.</b>

17:05.350 --> 17:08.620
<b>-Throw him into jail.
-Yes, sir.</b>

17:14.260 --> 17:15.760
<b>I'm terribly sorry.</b>

17:16.560 --> 17:19.100
<b>So on the way back from visiting
his family's grave</b>

17:19.230 --> 17:22.240
<b>for their death anniversary,
he saved Matahachi's wife and child?</b>

17:22.370 --> 17:23.370
<b>Yes.</b>

17:24.570 --> 17:28.140
<b>Koyanagi believed this to be some kind of fate.</b>

17:29.640 --> 17:32.650
<b>But Matahachi never showed up at Gotetsu?</b>

17:32.780 --> 17:34.080
<b>Right.</b>

17:34.220 --> 17:37.450
<b>There are no witnesses who claim
that they saw anyone like him there.</b>

17:37.790 --> 17:39.650
<b>I see.</b>

17:40.720 --> 17:43.830
<b>So he hasn't seen Otaka.</b>

17:47.200 --> 17:48.330
<b>Koyanagi.</b>

17:48.460 --> 17:51.630
<b>-Do you understand what you've done?
-Yes.</b>

17:52.570 --> 17:54.840
<b>Why did you act like a fool?</b>

17:56.340 --> 17:58.540
<b>I'm terribly sorry.</b>

17:59.540 --> 18:03.340
<b>So you're saying that
you have nothing more to say?</b>

18:03.480 --> 18:04.710
<b>Yes.</b>

18:06.550 --> 18:07.850
<b>Understood.</b>

18:09.320 --> 18:13.150
<b>He let a thief escape
and he's getting away with it?!</b>

18:13.290 --> 18:16.760
<b>What's Chief thinking?</b>

18:42.480 --> 18:47.620
<b>There hasn't been any investigation,
and Koyanagi has kept his silence since then.</b>

18:47.760 --> 18:50.490
<b>What is Chief gonna do?</b>

18:50.890 --> 18:54.530
<b>It's been almost six months.</b>

19:01.240 --> 19:03.510
<b>Raise your head.</b>

19:05.540 --> 19:06.810
<b>It's been a while.</b>

19:07.640 --> 19:11.410
<b>The morning glories have already bloomed outside.</b>

19:14.320 --> 19:15.720
<b>Koyanagi.</b>

19:15.850 --> 19:18.820
<b>I've got to pass a sentence on you soon.</b>

19:21.420 --> 19:24.230
<b>Do you have anything to tell me?</b>

19:28.200 --> 19:29.860
<b>Chief.</b>

19:30.200 --> 19:31.830
<b>Chief!</b>

19:32.770 --> 19:33.840
<b>What's the matter?</b>

19:35.570 --> 19:39.240
<b>-Matahachi has returned!
-What?!</b>

19:39.840 --> 19:41.940
<b>Did he bring back the gift?!</b>

19:55.520 --> 19:56.890
<b>Who's this?</b>

19:57.230 --> 20:00.400
<b>He's Monzaburo of Amabata.</b>

20:02.760 --> 20:04.970
<b>So he's the accomplice who escaped.</b>

20:05.600 --> 20:07.970
<b>Yes, Mr. Hasegawa!</b>

20:08.570 --> 20:10.570
<b>Koyanagi is completely innocent!</b>

20:11.670 --> 20:13.840
<b>It was all framed by me!</b>

20:13.980 --> 20:16.510
<b>I'm guilty for everything!</b>

20:16.710 --> 20:21.280
<b>Please forgive and let Koyanagi go!</b>

20:23.920 --> 20:27.390
<b>You're all completely...</b>

20:27.990 --> 20:30.430
<b>utterly audacious.</b>

20:35.930 --> 20:37.600
<b>Koyanagi.</b>

20:38.670 --> 20:40.600
<b>I know it's been a while,</b>

20:41.300 --> 20:44.740
<b>but are you able to go on duty today?</b>

20:46.010 --> 20:47.710
<b>Will you allow that?</b>

20:50.480 --> 20:52.280
<b>Be warned!</b>

20:52.410 --> 20:55.950
<b>Any of you could do what Koyanagi has done.</b>

20:56.820 --> 21:00.920
<b>But be prepared for hara-kiri when you fail.</b>

21:02.820 --> 21:05.290
<b>Just like him.</b>

21:07.000 --> 21:10.500
<b>I'll accompany you, of course.</b>

21:14.540 --> 21:17.710
<b>Father, so you knew all along?</b>

21:18.610 --> 21:24.350
<b>Without them knowing, something between
Koyanagi and Matahachi must've aligned perfectly.</b>

21:24.780 --> 21:28.020
<b>But, being aligned with a thief</b>

21:28.680 --> 21:30.450
<b>sure doesn't sound too appealing.</b>

21:30.890 --> 21:32.820
<b>Koyanagi and Matahachi</b>

21:32.950 --> 21:36.760
<b>are both unusually audacious fellows,
which is rare these days.</b>

21:38.990 --> 21:41.860
<b>Why are you making that face?</b>

21:42.360 --> 21:46.770
<b>Just thinking how I'll be seeing Koyanagi
at the dojo again.</b>

21:46.900 --> 21:49.340
<b>And I'm not looking forward to it.</b>

21:49.700 --> 21:52.610
<b>You should be more fired up than ever before.</b>

21:52.740 --> 21:55.440
<b>Let him train you properly.</b>

21:55.580 --> 22:02.550
<b>No. I hope he gets involved with
a widow who bewitches him next time.</b>

22:02.680 --> 22:06.050
<b>-Dear.
-You're audacious in a different way!</b>

22:21.040 --> 22:27.380
<b>People are creatures born from dreams</b>

22:27.510 --> 22:33.050
<b>How can the sky look so blue?</b>

22:33.380 --> 22:39.020
<b>The past and future are just short-lived moments</b>

22:39.490 --> 22:44.830
<b>that exist between the blink of an eye</b>

22:47.800 --> 22:50.030
<b>Oh time…</b>

22:50.360 --> 22:54.040
<b>I could be a flower of spring</b>

22:54.370 --> 22:59.070
<b>in my next life</b>

22:59.970 --> 23:05.050
<b>And then…live on</b>

23:05.910 --> 23:11.420
<b>…and then…be loved</b>

23:11.990 --> 23:14.920
<b>La la la</b>

23:20.130 --> 23:23.630
<b>And then…cry</b>

23:26.930 --> 23:32.940
<b>…and then…fall</b>

23:41.580 --> 23:45.050
<b>A Will-o'-the-wisp note was left behind
at the bloody scene.</b>

23:45.650 --> 23:50.420
<b>This triggers Omasa to remember her former lover.</b>

23:50.560 --> 23:51.960
<b>Next on Onihei.</b>

23:52.090 --> 23:53.960
<b>Will-o'-the-wisp.</b>
